142	 * Canvas+PlaybackBar, Timeline each in a static region. No dockable
143	 * Split/Stack/Panel tree, no layout-undo (ADR-011) — `docs/17-ui/docking.md`'s
144	 * real engine is deferred to its own future pass (Phase 15 scope decision).
